{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yxF4TgUg9i1794475099.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區主要股市終止連日升勢。</p><p></p><p>日本股市先升後回落，曾升逾500點，迫近61,800點前有阻力，收市輕微倒跌。</p><p></p><p>韓國曾經急跌百分之1.5，收市險守5,300點關口。</p><p></p><p>台灣股市一度跌穿43,000點關口。</p><p></p><p>澳洲股市結束三連升。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.920803+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:28.686791+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:28.686791+00:00","content_hash":"39f14798e5ffc3bb751212c5324b351825351444752ae7efa570653cefb9e7e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}